{
  "name": "outreach-engine",
  "description": "Domain-agnostic enterprise outreach engine. Takes a product brief plus an Ideal Customer Profile and produces a complete cold-to-signed campaign package: ranked targets with fit scoring, per-target deep intelligence dossier (recent statements, talking style, stated worries, hooks), per-target named decision-maker contacts (email, LinkedIn, phone, warm paths), per-target send pack (subject-line A/B set, cold email, LinkedIn DM, multi-touch follow-up cadence, escalation path, what-NOT-to-say), per-archetype one-pager copy, per-target meeting simulation, and a master execution playbook. Works for IP licensing, SaaS sales, partnerships, fundraising, services, channel sales  --  vertical specifics are passed in via inputs, not hardcoded.",
